# What never needs to reach the build context.
#
# node_modules above all: it is the largest thing in the working copy by far, it is
# rebuilt inside the image from the lockfile anyway, and shipping a Windows-resolved
# tree into an Alpine build is how a native binary ends up wrong.
node_modules
dist

.git
.gitignore
.claude

# The spikes are throwaway pages kept for the record; nothing in them is served.
spikes
docs

.DS_Store
*.local
.vite
